Keys

Everywhere

  1-5, tab    show a tab; shift+tab goes back
  r           start a run, on the Dashboard: market, dry run or live, a maximum
  x           stop the run in progress, whoever started it
  s           the setup checklist
  ?           this list; Esc closes it
  q           quit, as Ctrl-C does (a run in progress keeps running)
















